# Machine-local harness index — a SQLite DB, a FAISS vector file and a lock,
# rebuilt on demand by the harness indexer and meaningless on another box.
# Ignored rather than committed for the same reason canvas, aaas.com and the
# harness repo itself ignore it: generated per-machine state, not source.
.claude-index/
